  "worked_solution": "Substituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ directly into the limit, we have\n\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to (\\pi /3)}({tan}^{2}\u2061(x)+3{cot}^{2}\u2061(x)) & ={tan}^{2}\u2061(\\frac{\\pi }{3})+3{cot}^{2}\u2061(\\frac{\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & ={(\\operatorname{tan}\u2061(\\frac{\\pi }{3}))}^{2}+3{(\\operatorname{cot}\u2061(\\frac{\\pi }{3}))}^{2} \\\\  & ={(\\sqrt{3})}^{2}+3{(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3})}^{2} \\\\  & =3+3(\\frac{3}{9}) \\\\  & =3+1 \\\\  & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
